# VTON Studio - Complete Product & Architecture Reference

## Product Overview

VTON Studio is a **fully client-side** AI-powered web application for generating photorealistic e-commerce fashion photography. It has **two feature modes** and **two operation modes**:

**Feature Modes:**
1. **Virtual Try-On (VTON)** — Upload product images (garments or footwear), configure models/poses/backgrounds, and generate professional fashion photography
2. **Model Swap** — Upload existing product photos with a model already wearing clothing, and replace the entire human model with a new person while preserving the clothing, pose, and optionally the background

**Operation Modes:**
1. **Single** — Process one product at a time with multiple pose outputs
2. **Bulk** — Process multiple products organized in folders with round-robin pairing of models, backgrounds, and complementary garments

**Product Categories:**
- **Clothing**: topwear, bottomwear, onepiece
- **Footwear**: casual shoes, formal shoes, sneakers, boots, sandals, loafers, heels, sports shoes, slippers (9 types)

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 16+ (App Router), React 19+, TypeScript 5
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 4 + shadcn/ui (New York style, Radix UI primitives)
- **AI**: `@google/genai` v1.41+ — Gemini 3 Pro (`gemini-3-pro-preview`) for prompt generation, Nano Banana Pro (`gemini-3-pro-image-preview`) for image generation
- **State**: Custom React hook (`useVTONStore`) with useState/useCallback/useMemo (no external state library)
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Color System**: OKLCH CSS variables with dark mode support
- **ZIP Export**: `jszip` (dynamically imported for bulk downloads)
- **Emoji Picker**: `emoji-mart` (for infographic USP badges)

